# ShadowRecomp - what goes on GitHub.
# This is an ALLOW-LIST: everything is ignored, then only what someone needs to BUILD and RUN the game (and the
# work-in-progress stage editor) is let back in. The crew's notes, tickets, tests, scripts and logs stay on the PC.
# A new file or folder stays local until it is added here on purpose.
# NEVER allowed: game files (disc, DOL, textures, audio, models), generated/ (code recompiled from the DOL),
# builds, play\, saves, logs, keys.

/*

# --- top level: the build ------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/VERSION
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/build.cmd
!/build_env.cmd
# inputs of tools/gen.py (function overrides / hooks)
!/overrides.txt
!/callhooks.txt
!/multientry.txt
!/dtscale.txt
!/tracefns.txt

# README screenshots
!/media/

# --- the game: runtime + Aurora ------------------------------------------------------------------
!/runtime/
/runtime/_retired/
!/third_party/
# nested git repo (reference only, clone it from codeberg.org/ChloeVZ/sh05-decomp)
/third_party/sh05-decomp/

# --- tools: the generator, the disc import, the stage editor -------------------------------------
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/gen.py
!/tools/dol.py
!/tools/lift.py
!/tools/one_archive.py
!/tools/texture_dump.py
!/tools/game_import/
!/tools/menu/
!/tools/audio/
!/tools/stage_editor/
!/tools/tilesets/
# neutral icon / art the build uses when the game-derived ones are not there (fresh clone)
!/tools/release/
/tools/release/*
!/tools/release/placeholder/

# --- work: only the symbol map tools/gen.py reads (names + addresses, no game code) --------------
!/work/
/work/*
!/work/dtk/
/work/dtk/*
!/work/dtk/config.yml
!/work/dtk/splits.txt
!/work/dtk/symbols.txt

# --- excluded inside the allowed folders ---------------------------------------------------------
# Game-derived art compiled into the exe (memory-card icon, title emblem / backdrop remakes); a fresh clone builds
# with tools/release/placeholder instead (CMakeLists.txt)
/runtime/shadow.ico
/runtime/assets/*.png
*.res
# game screenshots
/tools/stage_editor/capture/
# third-party binaries (dtk, ninja, ffmpeg): fetched by whoever builds, not committed
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb

# --- never, anywhere -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
openrouter_key.txt
*key*.txt
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.lnk
*.log
*.err
logs/
saves/
*.raw
*.iso
*.gcm
*.rvz
*.ciso
*.gcz
*.wbfs
*.nkit.*
*.dol
*.rel
*.one
*.txd
*.afs
*.adx
*.sfd
*.dff
*.bsp
*.snb
*.mtn
*.bon
*.tp
*.met
*.thp
*.dsp
*.ahx
shadow_settings.ini
shadow_state.ini
shadow_live.ini
shadow_cheats.ini
# the editor's crew test scripts (local)
/tools/stage_editor/test_events_v4.py
/tools/stage_editor/ui2/check_ui2.py
/tools/stage_editor/ui2/shot_ui2.py
/tools/stage_editor/ui2/selftest.md
